<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>开场 · 立问题</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>一次改动上线前，你们要过哪几道关</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 104, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", width: 70}}>01</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", width: 300}}>谁批</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>变更要审批、要有人复核</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 104, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", width: 70}}>02</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", width: 300}}>在哪个环境跑</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>生产不是谁都能碰、环境隔离</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 104, borderBottom: "none"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", width: 70}}>03</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", width: 300}}>留下什么记录</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>操作要留痕、出事能还原</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 18}}>这三道关不是我教的新东西——是你们现在就在做的。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>02 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
